Verified 2026-10-29: every Código de Protección y Defensa del Consumidor version's wording comes from an official text-layer source (MINJUS 3rd official edition, current to 27 Nov 2020, and its Texto anterior notes; Ley 30534's own text for art. 77; the MINJUS 2nd official edition for art. 106 before D.Leg. 1390; Congreso ADLP texts of Leyes 31207-32495, each paragraph checked word for word). The state on 27 Nov 2020 equals the 3rd edition exactly (182 provisions), on 31 May 2018 equals the 2nd edition word for word (178/178), and on 15 Aug 2024 equals Editora Peru's NLA consolidated text in 169/171 articles (art. 88: NLA had not yet inserted Ley 31763; art. V: spelling variant). Scratch build with all parts: check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors; --compare identical. Not included: changes by decretos legislativos or laws whose title does not name the Code after April 2025, and anything after Ley 32537 (26 Dec 2025); Ley 31763's day (60 business days) is counted, not sourced.
